    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapist... i dont know. i've talked to people. they just tell me how lucky i am because my life looks good from the outside. it makes it worse. it makes me feel like i'm a liar or something. honestly, i just want the noise to stop. i just want to not feel this heavy nothingness anymore. i want it to just be still.",
